{"seq":2,"slug":"social-institutions","title":"社会结构与制度","stage":"DONE","category":"sociology","chapterCount":7,"docCount":27,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions","rating":{"composite":3.81,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 社会结构与制度 简介\n\n社会结构与制度是社会学研究的核心领域，它探讨人类社会中那些持久、稳定且具有约束力的组织形式与规范体系。从家庭到国家，从教育到法律，每一种社会制度都在塑造着个体的生活机遇与集体的运行逻辑。理解这些制度如何形成、如何运作、如何变迁，是把握现代社会深层结构的关键。\n\n本知识库适合对社会学感兴趣的中高级读者，尤其是希望从制度视角理解社会运作机制的技术从业者、管理者和跨学科研究者。无论你是想深入理解教育如何再生产社会不平等，还是想分析平台经济如何重塑劳动关系，都能在这里找到系统性的分析框架。\n\n全书共分为七章，覆盖社会制度的主要领域。第一章**家庭与婚姻研究**从最基本的社会单元出发，考察家庭结构的历史变迁、婚姻模式、亲职实践与家庭多样性。第二章**教育社会学**分析教育制度如何在机会赋予与不平等再生产之间扮演双重角色。第三章**宗教社会学**讨论宗教作为社会力量的功能、世俗化进程以及宗教与政治的复杂交织。第四章**政治社会学**聚焦国家权力的合法性基础、公民参与的形式与限度，以及精英政治的结构性逻辑。第五章**经济社会学**揭示市场并非自然存在，而是嵌入社会关系之中，并深入探讨劳动力市场、消费文化与新兴平台经济。第六章**法律社会学**从法律的社会功能出发，分析法律意识的日常运作与惩罚机制背后的社会控制逻辑。第七章**城乡社会学**将空间维度引入社会分析，考察城市化、乡村转型、士绅化与城市治理等议题。\n\n建议的学习路径是先从第一章家庭制度入手，建立对社会制度分析的基本感觉，再依次推进到教育、宗教和政治三个传统制度领域。在此基础上，进入经济社会学和法律社会学，感受制度分析与结构批判的深度。最后以城乡社会学收尾，将空间与制度的交叉视角整合为完整的理解框架。当然，每一章都可以独立阅读，读者可以根据自身兴趣灵活选择切入点。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"family-marriage","title":"家庭与婚姻研究","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/family-marriage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"family-structure-evolution","title":"家庭结构的历史演变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/family-marriage/family-structure-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"marriage-partnership-patterns","title":"婚姻与伴侣关系模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/family-marriage/marriage-partnership-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"parenting-socialization","title":"亲职与家庭社会化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/family-marriage/parenting-socialization"},{"seq":4,"slug":"divorce-family-diversity","title":"离婚与家庭多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/family-marriage/divorce-family-diversity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"education-sociology","title":"教育社会学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/education-sociology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"education-social-reproduction","title":"教育与社会再生产","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/education-sociology/education-social-reproduction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"school-hidden-curriculum","title":"学校制度与隐性课程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/education-sociology/school-hidden-curriculum"},{"seq":3,"slug":"educational-inequality","title":"教育不平等与机会差距","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/education-sociology/educational-inequality"},{"seq":4,"slug":"higher-education-credentials","title":"高等教育与文凭社会","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/education-sociology/higher-education-credentials"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"religion-sociology","title":"宗教社会学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/religion-sociology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"religion-social-function","title":"宗教的社会功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/religion-sociology/religion-social-function"},{"seq":2,"slug":"secularization-debate","title":"世俗化与宗教复兴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/religion-sociology/secularization-debate"},{"seq":3,"slug":"new-religious-movements","title":"新兴宗教运动与灵性文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/religion-sociology/new-religious-movements"},{"seq":4,"slug":"religion-politics-identity","title":"宗教、政治与身份认同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/religion-sociology/religion-politics-identity"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"political-sociology","title":"政治社会学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/political-sociology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"state-power-legitimacy","title":"国家权力与合法性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-institutions/political-sociology/state-power-legitimacy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"political-participation-voting","title"